id=asem_mods
name=ASEM Mods (LSPosed)
version=v5.9
versionCode=20
author=Asem (t.me/Asemfuad)
description=New look (dark / light, like ASEM Recovery). Power menu: Recovery + Restart SystemUI (XOS style). Lock/unlock: louder sound x2..MAX (clean, no distortion) + vibration synced with it (switches + slider in the app). QS tiles + volume panel: your icon color (switches in the app). Volume panel: sound mode button + 3D haptics (vibrates with music / video, Low / Mid / Strong), white slider icons. Home icons: 7 plate styles (frosted light/dark, auto, tinted, clear, solid) + 3D effect, silhouettes (ASEM Mods app). Enable "ASEM Mods" in LSPosed.
